# --- icculus harness ---
# CLAUDE.md is a compiled artifact of .icculus/guidelines/* (regenerated by
# `icculus guidelines`). AGENTS.md is intentionally left tracked so changes to
# the compiled guidance still show up in diffs and review.
/CLAUDE.md
# .icculus/skills/ is a materialized artifact of the binary: copied from the
# bundled templates by init/upgrade and symlinked into .claude/skills/. It is
# re-creatable, never your own, so it is not committed.
/.icculus/skills/
# Everything under .claude/ is generated or ephemeral — the skill symlinks
# compiled by `icculus guidelines`, and the linked worktree checkouts created by
# the worktree hooks — EXCEPT your settings, which are tracked. (Leaving the
# worktree checkouts tracked would make the main checkout read "dirty" the
# moment a worktree is created, blocking graduation.)
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json
!/.claude/settings.local.json
